    "id": "week-subthemes",
    "title": {
      "en": "Weekly Subthemes",
      "zh": "每周子主题"
    },
    "body": {
      "en": "### Week 1: Nature Around Us\n\nChildren explore basic nature and weather elements through outdoor observation, sensory materials, simple art, music, and gentle handling routines.\n\n### Week 2: Animals and Sounds\n\nChildren meet familiar animals through models, puppets, pictures, sounds, movement imitation, care routines, and pretend play.\n\n### Week 3: Weather, Body Feeling and Movement\n\nChildren connect weather and nature language with body feelings and simple movement: hot/cold, rain/sun, walking, swimming, flying, jumping, and animal-style movement.\n\n### Week 4: Caring for Nature and Animals\n\nChildren revisit nature, weather, and animals through simple care routines: watering plants, giving pretend food/water to animals, touching gently, waiting for turns, and cleaning up nature or animal play materials.\n\n---",
      "zh": "### Week 1: Nature Around Us｜第一周：我们身边的自然\n\n儿童通过户外观察、感官材料、简单艺术、音乐和温和的操作常规来探索基本的自然和天气元素。\n\n### Week 2: Animals and Sounds｜第二周：动物与叫声\n\n儿童通过模型、木偶、图片、声音、动作模仿、照护常规和假装游戏来认识熟悉的动物。\n\n### Week 3: Weather, Body Feeling and Movement｜第三周：天气、身体感觉与动作\n\n儿童把天气和自然语言与身体感觉和简单动作连接起来：冷／热、雨／太阳、走、游、飞、跳以及动物式的动作。\n\n### Week 4: Caring for Nature and Animals｜第四周：照护自然与动物\n\n儿童通过简单的照护常规重新接触自然、天气和动物：给植物浇水、给动物假装喂食／喂水、轻柔触摸、等待轮流，以及收拾自然或动物游戏的材料。"
    },
